---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy note for Quarks & Qubits">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
    This site does not load analytics or advertising trackers. Your theme preference is stored in
    your browser. CERN hosting may set an operational cookie and retain server logs for security and
    reliability.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
    The publications page requests citation data from INSPIRE-HEP. Playing hosted videos or opening
    external links also contacts the relevant provider. These providers receive the information
    normally sent with a web request, including your IP address, and apply their own privacy
    policies.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
